  ('SX-FEDDEC-26OCT-H25', 'XEV-STD-ECO-01', 'XLSX-STANDARD', 'BINARY', 'Will the FOMC raise the federal funds target range by exactly 25 bp at its 27–28 Oct 2026 meeting? (Outcome set: Cut / Hold / Hike 25 / Hike >25)', NULL, '1', '1', '99', '1', '99', NULL, '100000', '250000', 'OPEN', '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00', '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00', '2026-10-28 23:59:00+00', '2026-10-28 23:59:00+00', 'Source Agency: Federal Reserve System – FOMC statement (federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm). SarvaeX oracle: automated ingest from Source Agency + independent second-source check; Settlement Committee confirms and publishes notice; 30-min review window before final payout.', 'ADMIN', '{"type":"binary_event","source_workbook":"Contracts.xlsx","worksheet":"1_Standard_Contracts","worksheet_row":4,"pair_id":"STD-ECO-01","leg":"Binary","category":"Economics","subcategory":"US monetary policy – FOMC decision","region":"Global","original_ticker":"SX-FEDDEC-26OCT-H25","encoding":{"divider":100,"decimals":2,"suffix":"¢"},"workbook":{"reference_platforms":"Kalshi (KXFEDDECISION); Polymarket; Limitless; Opinion","reference_id":"K:KXFEDDECISION-26SEP-H0 (Sep mtg, hold leg)","activity":"2259425.17","activity_unit":"contracts (Kalshi, 24h)","best_bid":"0.39","best_ask":"0.4","spread":"1","min_top_size":"5086","quote_gate":"PASS","expiry":"Last trade 28 Oct 2026 13:59 ET (1 min before FOMC statement)","settlement_time":"FOMC statement release, 28 Oct 2026 ~14:00 ET","structure":"Binary event contract (YES/NO). YES pays 1.00 USDC per contract if the Payout Criterion is met at Expiration, else 0. Price 0.01–0.99 USDC, tick 0.01; fully collateralised (max loss = premium). Mutually exclusive outcome set; exactly one bucket pays.","payoff_formula":"YES = 1 if (new upper bound − prior upper bound) = +0.25 pp, else 0.","tick_terms":"0.01 USDC; prices 0.01–0.99","multiplier_terms":"1 contract = 1 USDC max payout","resolution_criteria":"Change in the upper bound of the target range announced